<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia closing Oct. coffee registrations.</title>
<headline>Colombia closing Oct. coffee registrations.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's National Coffee Growers Federation said it was closing registrations for October shipment by Federation exporters as of Monday, Sept. 30.</p>
<p>A brief statement from Federation headquarters in Bogota did not indicate how much longer October registrations for private exporters would remain open.</p>
<p>Registration for November shipments by all exporters have been open since Sept. 12.</p>
<p>-- Juan Guillermo Londono, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944</p>
